#pragma once

/* Converted menu text retained as an authoritative Amiga build asset. */
#define HAR_TEXT_TITLE "* HARRIER ATTACK RELOADED *"
#define HAR_TEXT_SKILL_LEVEL "Skill level:"
#define HAR_TEXT_SKILL_VALUE "1"
#define HAR_TEXT_INPUT_LABEL "Input: "
#define HAR_TEXT_INPUT_METHOD "Joystick"
#define HAR_TEXT_JOYSTICK "Joystick"
#define HAR_TEXT_KEYBOARD "Keyboard"
#define HAR_TEXT_START_GAME "Start game"
#define HAR_TEXT_REDEFINE_KEYS "Redefine keys      "
#define HAR_TEXT_TRIBUTE " Harrier Attack! Original game concept by Robert White, founder and director of Durell Software. Programmed by Mike Richardson and published by Amsoft in 1984. CPC Plus adaptation by Chris Perver in 2025. Ported to the Amiga by Tonny Roger Holm in 2026. Hope you enjoy it! "
#define HAR_TEXT_FIELD_GUIDE_CLASSIC " CLASSIC MODE - Fly low to avoid the CPC enemy-aircraft trigger. Destroy ground targets and ships for points. Flak chips armour and smoke can damage the Harrier. Parachutes restore the Wingman, armour, rockets or bombs. Return to the carrier to rearm and complete the mission. "
#define HAR_TEXT_FIELD_GUIDE_ENHANCED " ENHANCED - Defend the carrier! CPU/P2 operates ship guns: aim with stick, Fire for bullets, Bomb for missiles. Ship missiles can hit Harrier! Wingman joins over land. Every destroyed helicopter drops R: collect, then LAND to repair 20% hull. Carry 3 kits. Steer an ejected pilot onto the deck to use a spare aircraft. Fly low and fast to reduce radar. Destroy Missile Tanks before they leave. F depots give 20% fuel. Parachutes restore Wingman, armour, ammo or aircraft. Return to the carrier after the mission. "
